{% extends "html_wrapper.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<h1>Curriculum</h1>

<p>Twelve tracks, from working software engineer to stellar engineer and data scientist.
Each lesson carries a status — <strong>planned</strong>, <strong>drafted</strong>, <strong>reviewed</strong>, or <strong>published</strong> — and this page is generated from that frontmatter, so it always reflects what actually exists.</p>

<p><strong>Current goal:</strong> the first vertical slice — Python Craft &rarr; Data Wrangling &rarr; Statistics &rarr; Machine Learning &rarr; a first capstone.</p>

<div class="module-grid">
{% for t in collections.curriculum %}
  <a class="module-card" href="/{{ t.slug }}/">
    <span class="card-meta">{{ t.num }}</span>
    <h2>{{ t.name }}</h2>
    <p>{{ t.tagline }}</p>
    {% if t.total > 0 %}
    <span class="card-meta">
      {{ t.published }} published
      {%- if t.drafted %} &middot; {{ t.drafted }} drafted{% endif %}
      {%- if t.reviewed %} &middot; {{ t.reviewed }} reviewed{% endif %}
      {%- if t.planned %} &middot; {{ t.planned }} planned{% endif %}
    </span>
    {% else %}
    <span class="card-meta">scaffolded — coming soon</span>
    {% endif %}
  </a>
{% endfor %}
</div>
{% endblock %}
